     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet hn-vs-5509cc9b0f4c</b></p><a name=\"hn-vs-5509cc9b0f4c\"> </a><a name=\"hchn-vs-5509cc9b0f4c\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html\"><code>http://ltc-ig.fhir.tw/CodeSystem/hn-answer</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?1.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-cc68466b93b24\">cc68466b93b24</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">可自行坐起，且由床移位至椅子或輪椅，使用輪椅的煞車及腳踏板，都不需要他人協助，且沒有安全上的顧慮。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-cb55a9db20aae\">cb55a9db20aae</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">移位時需要少部分協助或提醒，且有安全上的顧慮。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-c7c237f97e050\">c7c237f97e050</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">可自行坐起，但移位至椅子或輪椅，需他人大部份的協助。</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-c7eb787c445cb\">c7eb787c445cb</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">不能自行移位，完全需他人協助才能坐起或移位。</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
